    {
      "fragment_key": "transaction-effective-february-2024",
      "document_key": "sec-10k-capture",
      "excerpt": "The transaction became effective in February 2024 and included an upfront payment of $800 million, which will be included in Acquired IPRD during the first quarter of 2024. BMS is also obligated to pay up to $7.6 billion upon the achievement of contingent development, regulatory and sales-based milestones.",
